  shouts:
  - id: shout_ab_croak
    lines:
    - Croak, {musico}!
    - '{musico} is off-key! Croak!'
    - "Croak\u2026 croak\u2026 {musico}!"
  - id: shout_rayas_ab_cut_in
    lines:
    - Excuse me, I can't see!
    - "Lower\u2026 lower\u2026 there!"
    - Make way, this spot is mine!
  - id: shout_rayas_ab_elbow
    lines:
    - Take that, {musico}!
    - Call that a bassline, {musico}?
    - '{musico}, more bass!'
  - id: shout_tentaculos_ab_count_one
    lines:
    - "One\u2026"
  - id: shout_tentaculos_ab_count_two
    lines:
    - "Two\u2026"
  - id: shout_tentaculos_ab_count_three
    lines:
    - THREE, {musico}!
    - "And\u2026 THREE! This one's for you, {musico}!"
  - id: shout_big_guy_ab_boo
    lines:
    - "BOOO\u2026!"
    - Get off the stage, {musico}!
    - BOOO, {musico}! Your music stinks!
  - id: shout_kid_ab_egg_him_on
    lines:
    - Yeah, boss!
    - Go on, boss, go on!
    - Louder, boss!
  - id: shout_kid_ab_tantrum
    lines:
    - Boooring, {musico}!
    - Play another song, {musico}!
    - '{musico}, my ears hurt!'
  - id: shout_influencer_ab_egg_him_on
    lines:
    - Boss, you're on my story!
    - I'm posting this, boss. Go!
    - Boss, my followers are watching!
  - id: shout_influencer_ab_scathing_review
    lines:
    - One star, {musico}. And that's generous.
    - I could make that in 2 seconds with AI, {musico}.
    - '{musico}, this is going straight into my review.'
  - id: shout_ab_croak__robot_c2
    lines:
    - '{musico} can''t keep time! Croak!'
    - "Croak\u2026 what bar are you on, {musico}?"
    - You lost the tempo, {musico}! Croak!
  - id: shout_big_guy_ab_boo__robot_c2
    lines:
    - BOOO! Back to the factory, {musico}!
    - '{musico}, even the metronome gave up on you!'
  - id: shout_reina_gusano_ab_egg_one
    lines:
    - "One\u2026 for the hive."
    - Play, play. The brood is listening.
    - My little ones are hungry for music.
  - id: shout_reina_gusano_ab_egg_one__sibi
    lines:
    - "{musico}, my child\u2026 come back to the hive."
    - '{musico}, the hive is calling you.'
    - Playing for them, {musico}? You belong to the hive.
  - id: shout_reina_gusano_ab_egg_two
    lines:
    - "Two\u2026 they're stirring."
    - Louder. Let them hear it inside the egg.
    - Almost ready, my little ones.
  - id: shout_reina_gusano_ab_egg_two__sibi
    lines:
    - '{musico}, feel the hive. You always have.'
    - Come back, {musico}. Your siblings are about to hatch.
  - id: shout_reina_gusano_ab_hatch
    lines:
    - Hatch, my children!
    - Feast, my little ones!
    - The hive awakens!
  - id: shout_reina_gusano_ab_hatch__sibi
    lines:
    - 'Look, {musico}: your siblings!'
    - '{musico}, say hello to the family!'
